;; Command waidriver is wai's light driver (doc/wasm/WAI.md §5): it runs the plans arbace.wasm.check makes of the testsuite's
;; scripts, each command judged by its own assertion, and writes the rows [ID RESULT REASON].
;;
;;	waidriver wast PLANS.LIST ROWS.EDN           every plan of the list (NAME<tab>PLAN<tab>MODDIR a line)
